  "keyFeatures": [
    "Ingress throttling: auto-respond 429 TooManyRequests to over-quota clients",
    "Egress throttling: limit outbound calls via HttpClient DelegatingHandler",
    "Egress-to-ingress propagation of 429 responses",
    "Five rate limiting algorithms: FixedWindow, SlidingWindow, LeakyBucket, Semaphore, CircuitBreaker",
    "Four configuration methods: declarative (attributes), static (appsettings.json), programmatic, and reactive (hot-reload)",
    "IdentityIdExtractors for per-client rate limiting (IP, API key, header, claim, etc.)",
    "CostExtractors for weighted request costs and pricing tiers",
    "Distributed counter stores: Redis, Azure Table, IDistributedCache, EF Core",
    "Request deduplication via Semaphore with ReleaseAfterSeconds",
    "Custom response fabrics: delayed responses, spin-waits, and fully custom HTTP responses",
    "OpenTelemetry traces and metrics",
    "Generic .NET support via IThrottlingTroll for use in any .NET app"
  ],
